{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "The proposed development, for reasons of its massing and scale, would present an overwhelming addition to the host dwelling which would not have regard to the built form or modesty of the host dwelling or terrace row. It would appear overly bulky and out of character with the area. The development would therefore be contrary to the following policies which seek to ensure that developments are sympathetic to local character:Paragraph 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December, 2024);&nbsp;Policy D4 of The London Plan (March 2021);&nbsp;Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of the Local Plan (September 2024); and&nbsp;LBBD Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)",
    "The proposed development, for reasons of scale and siting, would result in a loss of outlook,&nbsp;loss of light and overbearing impact to neighbouring residential occupiers. It would restrict the light and openness to the amenity of neighbouring occupiers&nbsp;which would pose material harm. It&nbsp;therefore constitutes unneighbourly development which would be&nbsp;contrary to:&nbsp;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December, 2024);Policy D6&nbsp;of the London Plan (March 2021);The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012); andPolicies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of The Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September, 2024)",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><ul><li style=\"\">A01 - Block Plan &amp; Location Plan - 14/03/2025 </li><li style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">A001-2D</span> - Proposed Drawings - 14/03/2025</li></ul><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>"
  ],
